<title>GERMANY: Details of final '96 German federal budget.</title>
<headline>Details of final '96 German federal budget.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a table released by the Finance Ministry on Wednesday giving final German federal budget statistics for 1996. (Figures in billions of marks unless stated).</p>
<p>			    Plan	    Actual     Pct deviation</p>
<p> Spending		 451.3	   455.6	    +4.3</p>
<p> Change vs '95 (pct)   -2.9	    -2.0</p>
<p> Tax revenues	   351.2	   338.6	   -12.6</p>
<p> Other revenues	  40.2	    38.7	    -1.5</p>
<p> Deficit		   59.9	    78.3	   +18.4</p>
<p>-- Douglas Busvine, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
